{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05503","headline":"赠朱中书 · 丁仙芝","name":"赠朱中书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年种田滨五湖，十年遭涝尽爲芜。\n频年井税常不足，今年缗钱谁爲输。\n东邻转谷五之利，西邻贩缯日已贵。\n而我守道不迁业，谁能肯敢效此事。\n紫微侍郎白虎殿，出入通籍回天眷。\n晨趋彩笔柏梁篇，昼出雕盘大官膳。\n会应怜尔居素约，可即长年守贫贱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丁仙芝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05503.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05503","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}